1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:03,320
这不公平 你说了让我去的
It's so unfair. You told me I could go.

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:04,840
我说的是
I told you you could go if you

3
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,720
你历史课要拿到"良"才能去 可你没拿到
got a B on your History exam, which you didn't.

4
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,760
我有学习功能障碍
I have a learning disability.

5
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:10,480
课文的字母像是会跑会跳
The letters jump around on the page

6
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:11,440
而且还颠三倒四的
and appear backwards.

7
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:13,540
宝贝 咱去给医生检查过六七次了
Honey, we had you tested like six times.

8
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:15,500
相信我 我也宁可你真有阅读障碍
Trust me, I was praying for dyslexia.

9
00:00:15,671 --> 00:00:19,031
我的天啊 你就不能让我过得开心点吗
Oh, my God, why can't you ever let me have any fun?!

10
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,560
老爸 太恶心了
Ew. Ew. Dad, gross.

11
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:23,240
你的手都是起司味
Your hand smells like cheese!

12
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:25,040
我不想把餐刀弄脏嘛 坐下
I didn't want to dirty a knife. Sit.

13
00:00:27,130 --> 00:00:29,010
咱都知道每次迪蒂姥姥来的时候
Now, we all know when Nana Dede comes to visit,

14
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:30,540
-你们的妈都会有点... -抽风吗
- your mom can get a little... - Psycho?

15
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:31,480
-恐怖吗 -像发酒疯吗
- Scary. - Drunk?

16
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:32,600
都有
All true.

17
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:35,300
所以 我要你们都拿出最棒最乖的一面
Therefore, I need you guys to be on your best behavior.

18
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:37,280
别担心 我一向如此
Don't worry. I'll keep to myself.

19
00:00:37,439 --> 00:00:39,419
我还得练习我的大提琴独奏会曲目呢
I have to practice for my cello recital.

20
00:00:39,419 --> 00:00:40,919
随便你吧
Ohh, fine.

21
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:43,000
这样吧 只要能让你远离你妈的"雷区"
You know what? If it keeps you out of your mom's hair, yes,

22
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:43,700
就做吧
do that.

23
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:45,860
卢克 如果你妈要抓狂了
Luke, if your mom starts to lose it,

24
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:47,720
你一定要加倍卖萌 努力让她恢复正常
I need you to lighten the mood by being extra cute.

25
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:50,160
包我身上 我准备好了几招呢
No problem. I've got some stuff prepared.

26
00:00:50,908 --> 00:00:53,638
马麻 伦家好口渴哦
"Hey, mom, I'm firsty".

27
00:00:53,638 --> 00:00:55,488
不错吧 可爱不
Heh? Adorable, right?

28
00:00:55,488 --> 00:00:57,277
还...还行吧
Yeah, that's... that's good.

29
00:00:57,287 --> 00:01:00,067
别担心 我穿上睡衣 装可爱的效果就棒了
Don't worry. It works better in my jammies.

30
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:16,400
小卡 莫妮卡这周末来不了莉莉的生日会了
Cam, Monica can't come to Lily's birthday party this weekend.

31
00:01:16,460 --> 00:01:17,560
她妈妈要来芝加哥[双关演音乐剧"芝加哥"]
Her mom's gonna be in Chicago.

32
00:01:17,740 --> 00:01:19,680
太棒了 她要演啥
Oh, that's fantastic! What part is she playing?

33
00:01:20,940 --> 00:01:23,320
芝加哥 地名
The city of Chicago.

34
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:25,900
好吧 假设现在有枪指着你要你选
Okay. Gun to your head...

35
00:01:27,260 --> 00:01:27,980
你说哪双比较好
which pair should I wear?

36
00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:29,860
拿枪逼我选啊
Oh. Gun to my head.

37
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:31,420
我选直接毙了我吧
I'd say, pull the trigger.

38
00:01:31,780 --> 00:01:32,720
你这是啥意思
What's that supposed to mean?

39
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:33,540
不准演费兹波
No Fizbo.

40
00:01:34,054 --> 00:01:35,414
可是 为什么不行嘛
Okay, w-why?!

41
00:01:35,414 --> 00:01:38,674
小卡 莉莉的生日会焦点应该是莉莉
C-Cam, the center of attention at Lily's party should be Lily,

42
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:40,800
而不是想要众人关爱的小丑费兹波
not Fizbo the needy clown.

43
00:01:40,940 --> 00:01:42,440
不好意思没听清 你说谁想要众人关爱
I'm sorry. Excuse me. "Needy"?

44
00:01:42,460 --> 00:01:44,040
"他们为虾米不笑呢 米奇尔"
"Why aren't they laughing, Mitchell?

45
00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:45,120
"为虾米我从嘴里拉出一条手绢来
"Why aren't they clapping

46
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,960
"他们也不鼓掌呢"
when I'm pulling the handkerchief out of my mouth?"

47
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:47,920
那是条十英尺长的手绢
It's 10 feet long

48
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,220
而且最后一节还绑了四角裤
with boxer shorts at the end.

49
00:01:49,220 --> 00:01:50,680
完全没有理由不鼓掌
It works on so many levels.

50
00:01:51,112 --> 00:01:52,212
好吧 但是
Yeah. Well, also,

51
00:01:52,212 --> 00:01:54,772
这毕竟是"小公主"主题生日会 所以...
it's a princess theme party, so...

52
00:01:54,782 --> 00:01:57,082
你根本没把派对主题放在眼里吧
I guess you just don't respect party themes.

53
00:01:57,220 --> 00:01:59,280
你居然说这种话
You did not just say that.

54
00:01:59,752 --> 00:02:01,551
对不起 这...这说的是有点过分
I'm sorry. That was... That was crossing a line.

55
00:02:01,551 --> 00:02:02,581
非常过分
Yes, it was.

56
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:05,800
所以呢 费兹波能不能"来"生日会嘛
So? Can Fizbo come to the party?

57
00:02:05,860 --> 00:02:06,980
不 没戏
No! No!

58
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:10,220
你是莉莉的爸爸 以好爸爸的身份出席就行了
You are Lily's dad. Just be there as her dad.

59
00:02:10,340 --> 00:02:12,240
你是说我现在不是个好爸爸吗
Are you implying I'm not being a good dad now?

60
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:14,140
你说是就是呗...[双关"如果鞋子合脚"]
Well, if the shoe fits...

61
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:16,220
不合脚 它们都大得吓人
They don't. They're comically large.

62
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:21,620
老妈
Hey, mom.

63
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:25,980
爸爸和姥姥停好车了
Dad and nana just pulled in.

64
00:02:46,357 --> 00:02:47,877
克莱尔乖乖
Claire bear!

65
00:02:47,877 --> 00:02:49,847
我的小宝贝儿
Ohh. Oh, my sweet girl!

66
00:02:50,140 --> 00:02:52,060
天啊 我都忘了你都长这么大了
Gosh, I forget that you're all grown up.

67
00:02:52,540 --> 00:02:54,080
我总觉得你还是个12岁小姑娘似的
You know, in my mind, you're still 12.

68
00:02:54,316 --> 00:02:56,796
看看咱俩...两个小老太啦
Well, look at us... just two old ladies.

69
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,660
我们回来啦
We're home!

70
00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:02,640
回来就好
Oh, good.

71
00:03:02,876 --> 00:03:05,595
我们给莉莉买了非常棒的生日礼物哦
And we bought Lily a beautiful birthday gift.

72
00:03:05,700 --> 00:03:07,880
我本来一直争取买羊毛毯的
Yeah. I was pushing for a cashmere throw.

73
00:03:08,780 --> 00:03:11,140
杰 我买了本有声读物
Look, Jay. It's a talking storybook.

74
00:03:11,820 --> 00:03:13,600
咱们可以把声音录进去
We record ourselves reading it,

75
00:03:13,655 --> 00:03:14,605
这样到了晚上
and then at night,

76
00:03:14,605 --> 00:03:17,324
莉莉就能听着咱们的声音入睡了
Lily can hear our voices before she goes to sleep.

77
00:03:17,324 --> 00:03:18,304
糟透了
Terrible idea.

78
00:03:18,340 --> 00:03:19,880
就说还是羊绒永恒
Unlike the timelessness of cashmere.

79
00:03:19,980 --> 00:03:20,900
别再叨叨羊绒了
Enough with the cashmere!

80
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,960
这礼物哪里糟了嘛
Why is it a terrible idea?

81
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:25,140
你不记得答录机事件了吗
Don't you remember the answering-machine message?

82
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,680
你好 这里是杰...
Hi, you've reached Jay...

83
00:03:27,940 --> 00:03:28,680
和歌洛莉亚的家
And Gloria.

84
00:03:28,900 --> 00:03:33,560
请在这之后留下讯息... "嗒"
Please leave a message after the...

85
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,560
你没说"哔"
You didn't say "beep".

86
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:35,480
如果我说了"哔"字
If I say "beep",

87
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:37,020
别人可能以为这就是那声"哔"
then the people will think it's the beep.

88
00:03:37,140 --> 00:03:39,480
不会 他们知道该等到真正的"哔"声后的
No, I think they're gonna know to wait for the actual beep.

89
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:41,120
-我不觉得他们会知道 -听我的就对了
- I don't think they'll know. - Just trust me.

90
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:41,900
那好吧
Okay, fine.

91
00:03:44,340 --> 00:03:46,500
-你好 这里是杰... -和歌洛莉亚的家
- Hi, you've reached Jay... - And Gloria.

92
00:03:46,682 --> 00:03:50,211
请在"哔"声后留言
Please leave a message after the beeeeeep!

93
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:51,620
你闹啥呢
What was that?

94
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:52,840
你跟我讲要"哔"
You told me to make the beep.

95
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:54,460
我不是让你模仿"哔"声
No, I didn't tell you to make the beep.

96
00:03:54,480 --> 00:03:56,400
我是让你说哔字
I told you to say the word "beep."

97
00:03:56,500 --> 00:03:57,580
如果我说了哔字
If I say the word,

98
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:59,180
会让人以为那是真的"哔"声嘛
then people think it's the beep.

99
00:03:59,320 --> 00:04:01,700
-那不是真的"哔"声 -那干嘛还要说那哔字
- It's not the beep! - Then why even say it?!

100
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:04,440
对了
So, anyways,

101
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:07,040
你肯定猜不到我在机场碰到谁了
you'll never guess who I saw at the airport.

102
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,649
谁啊
Mm. Who's that?

103
00:04:08,649 --> 00:04:10,709
罗比·苏利文
Robbie Sullivan.

104
00:04:10,709 --> 00:04:13,209
罗比...跟我同一个高中的罗比·苏利文吗
Robbie... my Robbie Sullivan from high school?

105
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:15,560
天啊 我有...好几年没见过他了
God, I haven't seen him in...years.

106
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:16,600
应该是"几十年"了
Decades, really.

107
00:04:16,780 --> 00:04:18,300
我一直挺喜欢他的
I always liked him.

108
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:19,460
而且我还记得
And as I recall,

109
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:22,460
你们俩老是对对方毛手毛脚的
the two of you couldn't keep your hands off each other.

110
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:23,800
真的呀 老妈
Oh, really, mom?

111
00:04:23,840 --> 00:04:25,140
当然是...假的
That's...not true.

112
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:27,280
是真的 你日记里写的
It is true. I read it in your diary.

113
00:04:27,620 --> 00:04:29,960
你偷看我日记
You read my diary!

114
00:04:30,257 --> 00:04:31,507
好吧
Well...Yeah.

115
00:04:31,507 --> 00:04:32,687
我 我是读过
I-I read it

116
00:04:33,380 --> 00:04:36,580
我这不想看看你嗑没嗑药嘛
because I wanted to see if you were on drugs.

117
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:39,620
这是爱的管教 克莱尔
It's called parenting, Claire.

118
00:04:40,500 --> 00:04:42,600
-那 老妈 查德怎么样 -伙计
- So, mom, what's going on with Chad... - Okay, buddy.

119
00:04:42,756 --> 00:04:45,356
看来你得提前上前线了
we're gonna need you on the front lines sooner than expected.

120
00:04:45,356 --> 00:04:46,946
准备好卖萌了没
Are you ready to be cute?

121
00:04:46,946 --> 00:04:48,406
-废话 -上吧
- Please. - Go get 'em.

122
00:04:50,780 --> 00:04:52,880
妈咪 伦家的小肚肚咕噜咕噜的呢
Hi, mommy. My tummy's growling.

123
00:04:53,035 --> 00:04:54,705
伦家想吃通心粉粉嘛
Can I have some pas-ghetti?

124
00:04:54,820 --> 00:04:55,880
宝贝 你弄痛我了
Sweetie, you're hurting me.

125
00:04:55,940 --> 00:04:58,280
还有 今晚去洗个澡吧 你头发闻起来像起司
And take a shower tonight. Your hair smells like cheese.

126
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,760
我来开门
I'll get it.

127
00:05:03,900 --> 00:05:06,040
我要一个巨大号棒棒糖
Okay, I need a giant lollipop,

128
00:05:06,140 --> 00:05:07,180
现在就要
and I need it now.

129
00:05:08,260 --> 00:05:09,480
我的宝贝妞来了
Oh, there's my girl!

130
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:10,580
天啊
Oh, my God.

131
00:05:11,220 --> 00:05:12,380
-罗比 -瞅瞅你
- Robbie?! - Look at you!

132
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:13,600
惊喜啊
Surprise!

133
00:05:14,620 --> 00:05:16,580
我请他来吃晚饭的
I invited him to dinner!

134
00:05:16,760 --> 00:05:17,180
啥
What?

135
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:19,160
我就说了她会超激动吧
Didn't I tell you she'd be excited?

136
00:05:19,353 --> 00:05:20,573
我...
Huh? I... Uh-huh.

137
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:22,140
我不知道该说什么
I don't know what to say.

138
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:25,100
也许来杯气泡水果鸡尾酒能让你放松一下
Well, maybe a fuzzy navel wine cooler will loosen you up.

139
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,300
至少以前管用
Sure used to.

140
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:30,400
亲爱的 这是哪位
Hey, honey, who's this?

141
00:05:30,622 --> 00:05:31,892
这位是...
This is, um...

142
00:05:31,892 --> 00:05:33,062
罗比
Robbie...

143
00:05:33,220 --> 00:05:35,340
我十七岁时的男朋友
My boyfriend from when I was 17 years old,

144
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:37,500
我妈请他来吃晚饭
whom my mom invited to dinner.

145
00:05:37,631 --> 00:05:38,731
准备好要来狂欢了吗[直译为"系紧安全带"]
Fasten your seatbelts.

146
00:05:38,731 --> 00:05:39,701
我是菲尔·邓菲
Phil Dunphy.

147
00:05:39,701 --> 00:05:40,951
菲尔 你好 你和克莱尔怎么认识的
Hey, Phil. How do you know Claire?

148
00:05:41,340 --> 00:05:44,000
自打跟她结婚 我就认识她了
I know Claire from being married to Claire.

149
00:05:46,100 --> 00:05:47,750
等等
Wait a minute. Uh...

150
00:05:47,820 --> 00:05:49,940
我妈没跟你提我结婚了
Mom didn't mention that I'm married

151
00:05:49,940 --> 00:05:52,640
-还有仨娃吗 -没有 她只说
- with three kids? - No. All she said

152
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:54,620
你还在试图找寻生命的目标
was that you were still trying to figure out your life.

153
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:55,540
-真的 -对
- Really? - Yeah.

154
00:05:55,609 --> 00:05:57,109
-老妈 你怎么解释 -迪蒂
- Okay. Mom? - Dede?

155
00:05:57,180 --> 00:06:00,060
-谁不是在找目标呢 -不是吧
- Aren't we all? - Uh, no. Not really.

156
00:06:00,140 --> 00:06:02,060
你为什么不跟他说我结婚了
Why would you not mention that I'm married?

157
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:03,780
老天 克莱尔
Oh, God, Claire.

158
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:06,880
跟人家聊天干嘛一定得提到你
Not everything in a conversation is about you.

159
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:07,640
妈...
Mom...

160
00:06:08,060 --> 00:06:09,800
...麻烦您老来厨房一趟
...I could use some help in the kitchen.

161
00:06:09,848 --> 00:06:11,228
你说的哦 我可没说过
Your words, not mine.

162
00:06:15,308 --> 00:06:16,787
你开加长轿车来的?
You came here in a limo?

163
00:06:16,820 --> 00:06:18,100
没错 小朋友
Yep. That's right, little dude.

164
00:06:18,500 --> 00:06:19,220
你很有钱吗
Are you rich?

165
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,700
卢克 这样问很不礼貌哦
Luke, that's not polite.

166
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:21,880
罗比没准儿没什么钱
Maybe Robbie isn't rich,

167
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:24,160
他只是需要加长轿车来逃避醉驾盘查
but he needs a limo because he has a lot of DUIs.

168
00:06:24,580 --> 00:06:25,840
不 那是瞎扯
Nope. It's nothing like that.

169
00:06:26,060 --> 00:06:27,760
事实上 卢克 我富得流油
The truth is, Luke, I am rich,

170
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:29,040
当然不是指金钱上
but not with money.

171
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:30,800
我有迷人的腹肌
I've got my abs,

172
00:06:31,500 --> 00:06:32,580
外加一头秀发
I've got my hair,

173
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:35,980
我的工作就是开外面那辆加长轿车到处跑
and I've got a super-sweet job driving that limo outside.

174
00:06:35,980 --> 00:06:37,760
-酷毙了 -是很酷
- Cool. - It is cool.

175
00:06:38,820 --> 00:06:40,320
卢克 我和你爸
Hey, Luke, who's taller?

176
00:06:41,620 --> 00:06:42,420
谁个儿高
Me or your dad?

177
00:06:42,835 --> 00:06:45,705
我觉得咱们没必要...
Oh... I don't think we need to...

178
