Ah. Okay. Let's see.

199
00:07:44,100 --> 00:07:46,840
是不是要我到院子里举这书你才能看见啊
Do you want me to hold it and stand in the driveway?

200
00:07:48,549 --> 00:07:50,569
"老天啊 这鲑鱼真不错"
"Holy mackerel, this is good salmon."

201
00:07:50,569 --> 00:07:51,819
我觉得他们错过...
I feel like they missed an oppor...

202
