"然后小熊熊说..."
"And then the baby bear said..."

208
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:08,340
"妈咪晚安 爸爸安安
"Good night, mama. Good night, papa.

209
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:10,980
"这是我有生以来最高兴的一天"
This has been the best day ever."

210
00:08:11,540 --> 00:08:14,160
"接着她跟父母分别晚安亲亲
"And after she kissed her parents good night,

211
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:16,660
"然后慢慢进入梦乡
"she drifted off to sleep.

212
00:08:17,060 --> 00:08:18,160
"故事完"
"The end."

213
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:21,240
"她"吗 这是只小母熊啊
She? Baby bear's a girl?

214
00:08:21,260 --> 00:08:22,400
