Greatest news ever!

230
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,880
你同意了是吧
So you're okay with this?

231
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:55,340
也不能说很同意吧 但我理解
Well, I wouldn't say I'm okay with it, but I get it.

232
00:08:55,400 --> 00:08:57,740
其实我对去参加你朋友女儿的初次圣礼
I feel like I'm in the same boat with your friend's daughter's

233
