对 他正跟我家跟我家人共进晚餐呢
Yes, he is having dinner with my family.

240
00:09:15,181 --> 00:09:16,921
跟你们说
And let me tell you something.

241
00:09:16,921 --> 00:09:17,970
那小妞超肥的
This chick was fat.

242
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:21,360
