好吧 你继续
All right. Let's hear it.

250
00:09:37,589 --> 00:09:38,808
费兹波·拉特
Sir Fizbo-lot,

251
00:09:38,808 --> 00:09:41,538
皇家剧团御用小丑 为您效劳
royal court Jester, at your service.

252
00:09:41,538 --> 00:09:43,428
我听说这儿有位小公主
I understand there's a little princess

253
00:09:43,428 --> 00:09:46,598
想乐呵乐呵
'oos in need of a jolly good time!

254
00:09:47,300 --> 00:09:48,020
没戏
No!

255
00:09:48,848 --> 00:09:50,467
殿下 您说过小丑
Your 'ighness said that the clown

256
