310
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:45,080
是啊是啊
Yeah. Yes.

311
00:11:45,380 --> 00:11:45,480
对的
Yeah.

312
00:11:46,420 --> 00:11:48,280
记得那之后我们做了什么吗
Do you remember what we did after that?

313
