看来 她一直都是希望你嫁给罗比
Apparently, she always wished you'd married Robbie.

352
00:13:06,560 --> 00:13:07,300
不是的 亲爱的
Oh, no, sweetie.

353
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:10,620
