This was all about her trying to annoy me.

354
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:13,240
算了吧 它实际上是想让你们两个结婚来着
Come on. She's practically walking you two down the aisle.

355
00:13:14,660 --> 00:13:15,140
他的电话
His phone.

356
00:13:15,728 --> 00:13:17,878
这些年来 我送给她的那些母亲节贺卡
All those mother's day cards I sent her...

357
00:13:17,878 --> 00:13:20,178
还有那些她转给我的那些
All those joke e-mails she forwarded to me

358
00:13:20,188 --> 00:13:22,167
我老早就看过的笑话邮件
months after I'd already seen them.

359
00:13:22,167 --> 00:13:24,437
我以后再也不会礼貌的回你"哈哈"了 迪蒂
Well, no more polite "LOLs" for you, Dede.

360
00:13:26,657 --> 00:13:28,377
不会吧 我擦
Oh! Oh! Holy cow!

361
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:30,440
好吧 好吧
Wow. Okay, well...

362
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:32,320
你是对的 不是针对我
You were right. It's not about me.

363
00:13:32,500 --> 00:13:33,020
天呐
Oh, God.

364
00:13:36,296 --> 00:13:38,946
你是公主
You are princess...

365
00:13:40,736 --> 00:13:43,006
别盯着公主看了 你会吓到她的
Stop eyeing the princess. You're gonna freak her out.

366
00:13:43,006 --> 00:13:43,635
我不知道
I don't know.

367
00:13:43,635 --> 00:13:46,075
我觉得整个等待王子过来
I-I think the whole idea of needing a prince to come along

368
00:13:46,075 --> 00:13:47,125
让你开心笑开怀的桥段
and make you happy,

369
00:13:47,125 --> 00:13:48,655
会传达错误的信息 米奇尔
sends the wrong message, Mitchell.

370
00:13:48,655 --> 00:13:49,435
我真这么觉得
I really do.

371
00:13:49,435 --> 00:13:50,145
真的吗 一个成年男子
Really? And a grown man

372
00:13:50,145 --> 00:13:52,075
从嘴里拉出四角裤就不会传达错误的信息吗
pulling boxer shorts out of his mouth doesn't.

373
00:13:52,075 --> 00:13:53,915
我
I'm...

374
00:13:53,915 --> 00:13:55,964
-你好啊 -好好好好好好
- Hey. - Hi. Hi. Hi. Hi. Hi. Hi. Hi. Hi.

375
00:13:55,964 --> 00:13:56,984
你好 亲爱的
Hi. Hi, sweetie.

376
00:13:56,984 --> 00:13:58,014
你好菲尔
Hey, Phil.

377
00:13:58,540 --> 00:14:00,040
那么 她在哪里 妈妈在哪里
So...Where is she? Where's mom?

378
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:01,560
先来把尴尬的部分先处理掉吧
Yeah, let's get the weirdness over with.

379
00:14:01,964 --> 00:14:02,974
没有啊 我以为她和你一起来呢
Oh, no. I thought she was coming with you.

380
00:14:02,974 --> 00:14:03,884
没有没有
Oh, no, no.

381
00:14:03,884 --> 00:14:05,943
我们自从... 那天之后就没见过他
I haven't seen mom since... let's see...

382
00:14:05,943 --> 00:14:07,953
对了 是昨晚 她还和我前男友亲热了
oh, she made out with my ex-boyfriend last night.

383
00:14:07,963 --> 00:14:08,593
-什么 -真的
- What? - Yeah.

384
00:14:08,593 --> 00:14:09,793
不 我的天呐
No, my God!

385
00:14:09,793 --> 00:14:10,973
真的 真的
Yeah. Yeah.

386
00:14:10,983 --> 00:14:12,393
然后就和他一起离开了
And then she took off with him,

387
00:14:12,393 --> 00:14:14,693
直到我睡着以前都没有回来
didn't come back to the house until after I was asleep,

388
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:16,500
今早又留了张可爱的小纸条
and then this morning left a cute little note

389
00:14:16,500 --> 00:14:18,440
上面说 和罗比享用早餐
that said, "Having breakfast with Robbie!"

390
00:14:18,800 --> 00:14:20,960
她到底在干什么 他只有她一半大
What the hell is she doing? He's half her age!

391
00:14:22,402 --> 00:14:23,502
不准说
Don't say it.

392
00:14:23,640 --> 00:14:24,720
我觉得这很甜蜜
I think it's sweet.

393
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:27,700
爱情是很美丽的 和年纪无关
Love is beautiful. It has no age.

394
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:29,960
当爱来的时候 就爱吧
When it's meant to be, it's meant to be.

395
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:32,140
就是这样的
That is the question.

396
00:14:32,520 --> 00:14:33,560
老爸 她怎么了
Dad, what's going on over there?

397
00:14:33,700 --> 00:14:36,020
你妈妈会来 让她有些紧张
She was a little nervous about your mother being here,

398
00:14:36,020 --> 00:14:37,640
她吃了第一片阿普唑仑
so she tried her first Xanax,

399
00:14:37,900 --> 00:14:39,420
还是用龙舌兰酒喝下去的
washed it down with a shot of tequila.

400
00:14:39,640 --> 00:14:44,120
看看 那个公主 太美了
Ay, look at the princess. It's so beautiful.

401
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:46,040
是吗 我可没看出来
Really? 'Cause I don't see it.

402
00:14:47,140 --> 00:14:48,140
借过
Excuse me.

403
00:14:48,820 --> 00:14:50,660
这就是我们的小寿星
There's the birthday girl!

404
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:51,900
荧光粉吗
Glitter?

405
00:14:52,140 --> 00:14:53,440
她会吸进肺里的
That'll settle in her lungs.

406
00:14:54,340 --> 00:14:57,000
我是想问问 你想要哪一种付款方式
So, I wanted to ask what method of payment you prefer...

407
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,660
现金 刷卡还是支票
Cash, credit card, check?

408
00:14:59,108 --> 00:15:01,308
为什么给钱 公主不需要报酬
Why, princesses don't get paid,

409
00:15:01,308 --> 00:15:04,238
只需要笑声和亮晶晶的火花
except maybe in laughter and sparkles.

410
00:15:04,620 --> 00:15:06,160
很可爱 但是我真想知道
That's nice. But I really need to know.

411
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:09,920
我要的只是小寿星的生日愿望
All I ask is that a little girl's birthday wishes...

412
00:15:09,920 --> 00:15:11,160
实现
Come true

413
00:15:11,300 --> 00:15:11,940
小姐 说真的
Miss, seriously,

414
00:15:11,960 --> 00:15:13,020
你要是想得到报酬 我得有你的
if you want to get paid, I need to...

415
00:15:13,020 --> 00:15:15,000
好吧 你可以用支票付给派对明星公司
Fine. You can make the check out to Party Stars Incorporated.

416
00:15:15,180 --> 00:15:17,080
永远不能停演角色 绝对不行
Never break character. Never, ever!

417
00:15:17,340 --> 00:15:18,500
-但是 -没有但是
- But... - "But" Nothing.

418
00:15:18,580 --> 00:15:20,560
我当小丑的时候 我鞋子着火了
When I was a clown, my shoe caught on fire,

419
00:15:20,560 --> 00:15:21,740
我一起的一个小丑
and one of my fellow clowns

420
00:15:21,740 --> 00:15:23,920
用了易燃的彩纸桶来帮我灭火
put me out with a bucket of flammable confetti.

421
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:24,620
怎么了
What's happening?

422
00:15:24,700 --> 00:15:26,360
就连他们抬我上救护车的时候
Even as they loaded me into the ambulance,

423
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:28,020
我还在吹气球折动物
I continued to make balloon animals!

424
00:15:28,036 --> 00:15:29,086
易燃的彩纸吗
Flammable confetti?

425
00:15:29,086 --> 00:15:31,635
当时有一瓶气泡矿泉水也没用它
There was a Seltzer bottle right there!

426
00:15:31,635 --> 00:15:33,285
你好
Oh, hi!

427
00:15:35,220 --> 00:15:36,880
我真不敢相信
I cannot believe it.

428
00:15:36,880 --> 00:15:37,920
她把他带到派对来了
She brought him to the party!

429
00:15:38,245 --> 00:15:39,495
天呐 我要去杀了她
Oh, my God! I'm gonna kill her.

430
00:15:39,495 --> 00:15:41,164
-我要 -停下 别 现在别
- I'm gonna... - Stop. No, not... not now.

431
00:15:41,164 --> 00:15:42,964
我最不需要的就是来个大闹剧 克莱尔
The last thing I need is some big scene, Claire.

432
00:15:42,964 --> 00:15:44,964
你知道她这样做只是要折磨我
You know, she's doing this just to torture me.

433
00:15:44,974 --> 00:15:46,634
不 不 她这是为了报复我
No, no. She's doing this to get back at me

434
00:15:46,634 --> 00:15:47,634
因为我不想让她和我们住一起
because I didn't let her stay with us.

435
00:15:47,634 --> 00:15:49,574
你们都错了 是因为我
You're both wrong. This is about me.

436
00:15:49,574 --> 00:15:51,873
我娶了年轻的姑娘 她就带个小伙子
I got the young girl. She had to get the young guy.

437
00:15:51,873 --> 00:15:53,173
她和我还挺好
Well, she and I are good.

438
00:15:53,173 --> 00:15:54,763
我们昨晚灌完那一瓶酒
We had a long talk last night

439
00:15:54,763 --> 00:15:56,503
长谈了一次
after you and I "split" that bottle of wine,

440
00:15:56,620 --> 00:15:58,500
然后你在楼梯上睡着了
and you "fell asleep" on the stairs.

441
00:15:58,500 --> 00:16:02,460
我不明白为什么大家对这事都很不爽
I don't know why everybody's getting so upset about this.

442
00:16:02,560 --> 00:16:04,820
他们可能只是热情使然啊
Maybe it's about passion,

443
00:16:04,920 --> 00:16:07,320
或是肉体的需求
about what the body wants,

444
00:16:07,492 --> 00:16:09,092
或是她的心想要什么
what the... what the heart wants for the heart.

445
00:16:09,092 --> 00:16:09,972
老爸 真的 你能
Dad, seriously, can you

446
00:16:09,972 --> 00:16:11,832
处理一下这两麻烦人物吗
deal with Cheech and Chong?

447
00:16:12,020 --> 00:16:13,000
你们好啊
Hi, everyone.

448
00:16:13,231 --> 00:16:14,861
杰 歌洛莉亚
Jay, Gloria.

449
00:16:14,861 --> 00:16:16,731
早上好 迪蒂
Oh, buenos dias, Dede...

450
00:16:16,731 --> 00:16:18,031
你好啊 美女
B-buenos...

451
00:16:18,031 --> 00:16:19,151
好了 歌洛莉亚
Uh, yeah. Uh, Gloria...

452
00:16:19,151 --> 00:16:20,171
来吧
Come on.

453
00:16:20,340 --> 00:16:20,820
可以了
That's enough.

454
00:16:21,900 --> 00:16:22,900
老妈
Hi, mom. Hi.

455
00:16:23,121 --> 00:16:24,440
米奇尔
Oh, Mitchell. Mwah!

456
00:16:24,440 --> 00:16:26,090
谢谢你来出席
Thank you for coming.

457
00:16:26,090 --> 00:16:27,270
你记得罗比吧
Oh! You remember Robbie.

458
00:16:27,280 --> 00:16:29,140
是啊 记得 记得 你好
Yes, I do. Yes. Hi.

459
00:16:29,540 --> 00:16:31,460
那是莉莉
Oh! That's Lily!

460
00:16:32,540 --> 00:16:33,740
我想你们完全没试着
Oh! I guess you're trying

461
00:16:33,740 --> 00:16:35,820
把我送她的衣服保持干净
to keep the outfit I sent her clean.

462
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:38,480
罗比
So, Robbie,

463
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:40,420
感觉这些年你过得不错啊
it looks like the years have been treating you good, huh?

464
00:16:40,699 --> 00:16:42,169
-过的怎么样啊 小红帽 -好了
- Hey, what's up, Red? - Okay. Um...

465
00:16:42,169 --> 00:16:44,498
我喜欢这家伙 记得吗 我们以前经常
I love this guy. Remember, we used to wrestle around

466
00:16:44,498 --> 00:16:45,648
一起摔跤吗
all the time?

467
00:16:45,658 --> 00:16:46,908
行了 快停下 我宝宝在看吗
Yeah. Please stop. Is my baby watching?

468
00:16:46,908 --> 00:16:47,968
真高兴见到你 伙计
Good to see you, man.

469
00:16:47,968 --> 00:16:49,358
我要跟你谈几句
I need to talk to you for a second.

470
00:16:49,358 --> 00:16:50,738
让我
Let me just...

471
00:16:50,738 --> 00:16:52,108
问你些事情
...ask you a little something.

472
00:16:52,108 --> 00:16:53,648
你跟我妈在一起干什么
What are you doing with my mother?

473
00:16:53,648 --> 00:16:54,848
我有句话
Hey, I've got a code.

474
00:16:54,848 --> 00:16:57,347
"在加长轿车里发生的事 就留在车里吧"
What happens in the limo stays in the limo.

475
00:16:57,347 --> 00:16:58,397
她是我妈妈
She's my mother!

476
00:16:58,397 --> 00:17:00,397
听着 我知道这一切有点奇怪
Look, I know this is all a little freaky,

477
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:03,740
但是在高中时我就爱上你妈妈了
but I had a crush on your mother back in high school,

478
00:17:03,740 --> 00:17:06,540
而一直以来我都在幻想这事
and it's always been kind of a fantasy for me.

479
00:17:07,640 --> 00:17:10,620
你那时和我约会 还对我妈妈抱有幻想啊
You were dating me and fantasizing about my mother?

480
00:17:10,726 --> 00:17:11,856
惨了
Ohh, boy.

481
00:17:12,300 --> 00:17:12,800
怎么了
What?

482
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:16,540
我想我们都心知肚明你是在生气什么
I think we both know what this is really all about.

483
00:17:16,820 --> 00:17:17,480
不
Uh, no.

484
00:17:17,560 --> 00:17:18,660
你还是想要我的
You still want me.

485
00:17:18,700 --> 00:17:20,640
天呐 你是疯了吧
Oh, my God. Are you insane?

486
00:17:20,815 --> 00:17:23,965
你们两个怎么了
Oh, what's going on here, you two?

487
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:26,200
克莱尔还想要我
Claire still wants me.

488
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:27,080
不 别乱说
No. Don't.

489
00:17:27,324 --> 00:17:29,244
我本应预料到这事的
Oh...Oh, I should've seen this coming.

490
00:17:29,244 --> 00:17:29,954
是吗
Oh, really.

491
00:17:30,020 --> 00:17:31,620
她一看见我高兴
One minute she sees I'm happy,

492
00:17:32,494 --> 00:17:34,214
-她就想横刀夺爱 -我没有
- and she swoops in! - Didn't swoop!

493
00:17:34,214 --> 00:17:36,094
我没有 要是真有人想横刀 那也是你
I didn't swoop. If anybody swooped, it was you!

494
00:17:36,094 --> 00:17:36,504
是你横刀夺爱
You swooped!

495
00:17:36,504 --> 00:17:37,594
克莱尔 别吵 现在别 现在别吵
Claire, hush. Not now! Not now!

496
00:17:37,604 --> 00:17:38,533
别吵 别 停下吧 求你了
Not now. No, stop, please.

497
00:17:38,533 --> 00:17:42,133
她指责我试着把我前男友从她那里偷回来
She accused me of trying to steal my old boyfriend from her.

498
00:17:42,580 --> 00:17:43,820
好了 好了 那你快点
Okay, fine, but make it quick.

499
00:17:44,760 --> 00:17:47,620
为什么事情牵扯到你就会很难搞
Why does everything have to be so hard with you?

500
00:17:47,660 --> 00:17:50,740
你为什么就不能成为一个正常的老外婆
Why can't you just be a normal old grandma?!

501
00:17:51,260 --> 00:17:52,440
你为什么 为什么来这里
Why do you... you come in here,

502
00:17:52,482 --> 00:17:53,842
这对你就像是个恶心的游戏
it's some sort of sick game for you

503
00:17:53,842 --> 00:17:55,442
就是一直 推 推 推 推 推别人到极限
to just push people and push people and push people

504
00:17:55,452 --> 00:17:56,612
看看别人还可以容忍你多久
and see how far you can push them!

505
00:17:56,612 --> 00:17:57,952
很好 看看我啊
And so fine... Look at me!

506
00:17:57,952 --> 00:17:58,952
你赢了 你赢了
You win! You win!

507
00:17:58,952 --> 00:18:01,001
我在公主派对上大吼大叫 老妈
I'm screaming at a princess party, mom!

508
00:18:01,001 --> 00:18:02,721
-克莱尔 克莱尔 -我在大吼大叫
- Claire. Claire... - I'm screaming

509
00:18:02,721 --> 00:18:03,391
在一个公主派对上
at a princess party!

510
00:18:03,391 --> 00:18:04,551
克莱尔 克莱尔 克莱尔 克莱尔
Claire, Claire, Claire, Claire.

511
00:18:04,820 --> 00:18:05,100
罗比
Robbie?

512
00:18:05,620 --> 00:18:08,180
我觉得 你懂的 你应该走了
I think maybe, you know, you should take off.

513
00:18:08,300 --> 00:18:09,940
是的是的 我听见了 菲尔
Yeah, yeah, look, I hear you, Phil.

514
00:18:10,090 --> 00:18:12,360
不过我偷偷告诉你
Uh, but between you and me...

515
00:18:12,940 --> 00:18:14,520
我感觉那边的那个公主
I'm getting some serious vibes

516
00:18:14,520 --> 00:18:15,760
在对我放电
from the princess over here,

517
00:18:15,760 --> 00:18:17,220
我想留着看看有没有戏
and I'd kind of like to play that out.

518
00:18:17,660 --> 00:18:19,840
你该走了
Hey. Time to go.

519
00:18:19,960 --> 00:18:21,900
普先生 你好吗
Hey, Mr. P. How you been?

520
00:18:21,980 --> 00:18:22,760
我很好
I'm doing good.

521
00:18:22,760 --> 00:18:25,520
我以前就不喜欢你跟我女儿在地下室鬼混
But I never liked you in the basement with my daughter,

522
00:18:25,520 --> 00:18:27,660
我也不喜欢你和我前妻在这厮混
and I don't like you here with my ex.

523
00:18:28,340 --> 00:18:31,380
你懂吗 你那小小的恐吓
You know, your little intimidation game

524
00:18:31,380 --> 00:18:33,300
可能对我小时候有点用
may have worked on me when I was a kid,

525
00:18:33,300 --> 00:18:35,480
我现在已经完全长大了...
but I'm a full-grown man now...

526
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:37,760
我觉得我是该走了
And I think I should go.

527
00:18:43,560 --> 00:18:45,440
"让莉莉成为派对的主角"这事做得太好了
So much for keeping it all about Lily.

528
00:18:45,740 --> 00:18:47,500
是啊 我承认我控制不住
Well, yeah, and I certainly didn't help

529
00:18:47,500 --> 00:18:49,980
就跑去训斥那个很可爱的临时工公主
by berating that perfectly sweet journeyman princess like I did.

530
00:18:50,377 --> 00:18:51,807
天呐 看看这里
Oh, God, look at this place.

531
00:18:51,807 --> 00:18:53,276
每个人都吓坏了
Everybody's traumatized.

532
00:18:53,276 --> 00:18:54,916
我们需要有人来
Oh, we need somebody to

533
00:18:54,926 --> 00:18:57,126
把派对气氛再搞起来 你说是吧
pump some life back into this party, huh?

534
00:18:57,126 --> 00:18:58,796
我知道了 我去屋里放些音乐
I got this. I'll go in and turn on some music,

535
00:18:58,796 --> 00:19:00,586
拿出纸杯蛋糕 打开泡泡机器
bring out the cupcakes, pump up the bubble machine.

536
00:19:02,820 --> 00:19:03,220
或者
Or...

537
00:19:03,220 --> 00:19:04,680
你这是迂回的告诉我
Is that a roundabout way of saying

538
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:06,320
让某个小丑出现在派对上吗
a certain clown can come to the party?

539
00:19:06,560 --> 00:19:07,500
我之前错了
I was wrong.

540
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:09,780
哪个孩子不想要有个小丑爸爸啊
Every kid wants a clown for a dad.

541
00:19:10,255 --> 00:19:12,765
你的决定 让一个小女孩开心死了
Oh! You just made a little girl very happy.

542
00:19:12,765 --> 00:19:14,624
是啊 我知道
Yes, well, I can see that.

543
00:19:21,460 --> 00:19:21,960
你还好吧
You okay?

544
00:19:22,660 --> 00:19:23,300
我没事
I'm fine.

545
00:19:24,300 --> 00:19:25,440
我会没事的
I will be fine.

546
00:19:25,583 --> 00:19:28,053
你知道克莱尔压力太大爆发后 会说气话的
'Cause you know Claire gets stressed out.

547
00:19:28,053 --> 00:19:29,473
她在那里说的那些
That stuff she said out there...

548
00:19:29,520 --> 00:19:30,360
都是实话
Was all true.

549
00:19:31,040 --> 00:19:31,520
是啊
Yeah.

550
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:35,460
不知道我是怎么想 会和他在一起
I don't know what I was thinking with him.

551
00:19:36,140 --> 00:19:37,580
我觉得像个傻子
I feel like such a fool.

552
00:19:37,760 --> 00:19:39,880
你只是因为一个小伙子的注意有点飘飘然了
You got flattered by the attention of a younger guy,

553
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:41,240
所以你有点太奔放了
and you got a little carried away.

554
00:19:41,500 --> 00:19:43,520
-那又怎样 -不是那样的
- So what? - It's not that.

555
00:19:43,660 --> 00:19:45,640
我和你离婚
It's... I divorced you,

556
00:19:45,640 --> 00:19:47,840
是因为我想追寻不一样的人事物
because I was looking for something else.

557
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:49,440
但我到现在都还没找到
I haven't found it.

558
00:19:49,440 --> 00:19:51,540
但当我回来的时候
But when I come back here,

559
00:19:51,540 --> 00:19:53,720
我觉得我得证明一些事情
I feel like I have to prove something.

560
00:19:54,120 --> 00:19:56,740
就像人家看着我
Like people are looking at me,

561
00:19:56,740 --> 00:19:58,960
说 你破坏了这个家庭
saying, "You broke up the family.

562
00:19:59,020 --> 00:20:00,380
你还想表示些什么
What do you have to show for it?"

563
00:20:00,380 --> 00:20:01,440
你做的对的
You did the right thing.

564
00:20:01,480 --> 00:20:02,320
我们失控了
We were stalled.

565
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:04,360
我没胆去结束
I didn't have the guts to end it.

566
00:20:04,460 --> 00:20:06,660
因为你是个好男人
That's because you're a decent man.

567
00:20:07,280 --> 00:20:09,240
那也没让事情更简单些
And that doesn't make it any easier.

568
00:20:09,840 --> 00:20:13,120
我只是不想被认为是个疯狂的姥姥
I just don't want to be thought of as "crazy nana".

569
00:20:13,340 --> 00:20:15,320
那不是真的我
That's not really who I am.

570
00:20:15,600 --> 00:20:18,900
我觉得 更重要的是
I think, more than anything else,

571
00:20:18,900 --> 00:20:20,940
我真的问题
my real problem...

572
00:20:20,940 --> 00:20:21,960
是她
is her!

573
00:20:22,798 --> 00:20:24,068
什么
Huh?

574
00:20:24,068 --> 00:20:26,308
不要 迪蒂 你在干什么
No, Dede!

575
00:20:26,520 --> 00:20:29,200
也许 这也不是因为我
So, maybe it isn't about me?

576
00:20:29,200 --> 00:20:29,880
或者我
Or me.

577
00:20:30,077 --> 00:20:31,007
我跟你们说了 是因为我
I told you it was about me!

578
00:20:31,007 --> 00:20:31,447
不要 不要
No! No!

579
00:20:31,620 --> 00:20:32,160
我来救歌洛莉亚
I got Gloria!

580
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:34,640
我来救歌洛莉亚
I got Gloria!

581
00:20:40,680 --> 00:20:42,720
这真是个珍贵的礼物
This is such a precious gift!

582
00:20:42,866 --> 00:20:45,326
我知道 真不敢相信我爸爸坐下来做了这个
I know. I can't believe my dad sat down and did this.

583
00:20:45,340 --> 00:20:45,880
继续
Keep going.

584
00:20:46,980 --> 00:20:49,080
杰 集中注意力 到你念台词了
Jay, pay attention. It's your line!

585
00:20:49,220 --> 00:20:50,700
我才刚念完一句白痴台词
I just had a damn line.

586
00:20:51,120 --> 00:20:52,520
曼尼 帮我添酒
Manny, freshen this up for me.

587
00:20:53,160 --> 00:20:54,740
不行 我们完成之前不能再喝酒
No, no more drinks until we finish this.

588
00:20:54,835 --> 00:20:57,695
管他呢 反正小卡也会婉拒这东西
Who cares? Cam's just gonna return it anyway.

589
00:20:57,700 --> 00:20:58,980
惊呼开始
Cue gasp.
